    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "point-2",
      "narration_text": "Then the captions froze at twenty-three seconds and drifted out of sync. Manim's frozen-frame optimization skips updaters during long waits. The fix: turn frozen frames off, and precompute the caption schedule.",
